controls:
WASD or arrow keys to move;
Swipe to rotate camera (click and drag);
F to enter or leave a vehicle;
E to attack;
Space to jump;
Left shift to run;
Escape or tab to toggle pause menu.

Move car: WASD keys or Arrow keys;
Brake and drift: Handbrake key;
Change camera: C key;
Gear up: Left Shift;
Gear down: Left Ctrl;

Move - W, A, S, D;
Jump - Space;
Buy / Steal - E;
Attack / Hit - Left Mouse Click;
Sprint - Left Shift​;
I - Open Inventory;
L - Show Cursor;

