- Jump: W / ⬆️;
- Slide: S / ⬇️;

- Move: WASD;
- Look around: Hold Left CLICK and move the mouse;
- Actions: Left CLICK;

Move: WASD / Arrow keys;
Look around: mouse;
Jump: SPACE;

W A S D – Dash around;
Space – Quick restart if you go flying;
Tab – Pause and catch your breath;

Computer:
- Use the WASD or the Arrow keys to move your character;
- Use the Space key to attack a crewmate;
- Press E to clean up;
- You can also use the scroll pad and left-click to do the above actions.

Mobile:
- Use touchscreen to move and kill.

- Move: WASD/arrow keys or drag mouse;
- Strike Lightning: Spacebar;
- Zoom in/out: Mouse scroll wheel.

- Arrow keys to move left or right;
- Space (or up arrow) key to jump;
- Hold space for a higher hump.

Player 1:

- Press A - move left;
- Press D - move right;
- Press W - throw ball;

Player 2:

- Left arrow – move left
- Right arrow – move right
- Up arrow – throw ball

Move: Arrow keys or WASD;
Jump: Z, C, or Space;
Dive: X, K, or Shift;
Pause: Enter;
Mute: M;
